00:01:37.064 --> 00:01:39.435
But what makes 
for good deliberative rhetoric,

00:01:39.435 --> 00:01:41.465
besides the future tense?

00:01:41.465 --> 00:01:44.923
According to Aristotle, there are three
persuasive appeals:

00:01:44.923 --> 00:01:46.066
ethos,

00:01:46.066 --> 00:01:47.025
logos,

00:01:47.025 --> 00:01:48.477
and pathos.

00:01:48.477 --> 00:01:52.145
Ethos is how you convince an audience
of your credibility.

